 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Carmine: \"I've heard good things about Emberhold. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They settle in like someone glad you're here."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Emberhold."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"What do you make of all this? Really.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Bleak. Probably true. I keep looking for the part where it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Permit me: Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Kennedy owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Meera grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "🤝 Carmine is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I feel like — ...Hi. Sorry. I'm not good at the talking-to-strangers part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. \"Oh. Okay. That's... that's fine, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Strangers are just people you haven't disappointed yet. That's what my mother said. Terrible advice, but it got me through parties. No pressure, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"It's not going away, so we adapt. That's what people do. We've always done it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on the big questions.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Carmine nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up, as it were?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"I dreamed Kennedy was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I clean up other people's messes quietly. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"What are you hoping for? Not the big stuff. The small thing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"God, yes. That's the dream now. Eight hours of not being afraid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"A full night's sleep. Not safety, not answers — just eight hours where nothing needs me. That's my whole theology now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on what you're hoping for.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Kennedy is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Ursula nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I wake before anyone else at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Kennedy's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Carmine: \"I've heard good things about Ashford. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Ashford."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I've been turning something over. What do YOU think actually happened to us?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"That's where I keep landing too. The question is what it wants.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"My theory changes weekly. This week's: we're the control group. Somewhere there's a village that got instructions, and we're the ones they just... watched. Cheerful thought, right?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on what you think happened to us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Since Kennedy died... I keep expecting to see Kennedy at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Rosa nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Kennedy. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"About that question — What's something you're good at that nobody here knows about?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Noted. Filing that under 'extremely useful.' The village needs that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Their friendliness thins — still there, just held at arm's length."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Right. Still on what you're good at.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Kennedy always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"My part? I remember them. Someone has to do it properly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Carmine nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Dandelion — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Carmine: \"I've heard good things about Thornfield. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Thornfield."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Do you still count the days? I lost track days ago.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good. Keep counting. The days need witnesses.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on what day it is.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"You feel that? The air before a storm. That's the village right now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Ursula nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — I hate to ask twice, but it's still open. Will you?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 6 liters, 9 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Everyone's choosing sides and pretending they aren't. I hate it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Let me sit with all that. We'll pick it up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Got a read on anyone here yet? Who should I be watching? ...if that makes sense.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Same. But keep your eyes open — some people here are performing, not surviving.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Watch the quiet ones. Not the loud — the loud tell you everything. The quiet are either thinking or planning, and you can't tell which until it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Still on your read on people here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Since Tariq died... I keep expecting to see Tariq at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Tariq said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "Carmine nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"You said you're better with your hands than people expect. I've been waiting to see.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "On the way, Ursula stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You show them Maypop — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind, friend?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Tariq owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"What scares you most about what's happening? The real answer.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They go quiet. \"Yeah. Me too. The randomness would almost be kinder.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Brian nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Home wasn't a building. It was a feeling. I'm chasing the feeling."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "On the way, Yesenia stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Home's a feeling, not a place. I'm chasing the feeling. Some days I get close.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Every camp I make, I try to make it feel like arriving. It never quite does. Yet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to find a place that feels like home.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Ursula nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Anyway — that's my cross to carry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Tariq is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You show them Pawpaw — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up? That means something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod, holding your gaze a beat longer. \"Hello?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. A grin breaks through, quick and warm."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. You press a hand to your own chest, then point at them. Together — they get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Hm. Almost.\" Sari corrects the one word, gently, like setting a bone. \"Again.\" You say it right. They nod, satisfied with both of you."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, a little quicker this time."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. They smile back, slower this time, like it just landed."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. You tap your chest, then theirs. Us. They nod, emphatic."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "A gesture, patient and clear: palms up, then toward you."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They glance toward their own thoughts; the exchange is winding down."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, slowly."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "A gesture, patient and clear: palms up, then toward you."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They nod along, following your hands more than your words."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They speak. You understand none of it. \"Okay?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod, holding your gaze a beat longer."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "A gesture, patient and clear: palms up, then toward you."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I'm keeping a photo of someone I left behind. I haven't told anyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Boris has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Do you believe in anything? Now, I mean. After everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — the need hasn't gone anywhere. I'm still asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 8 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Sari was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "You walk to the ridge with Ivy. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Yesenia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I oil boots on rest days at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I should go. Before I overthink this conversation too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
