  "deathBeat": [
   "d41: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Kennedy Santos is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d41: 🕯️ Kennedy Santos is dead — the expedition. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d41: The village's quarrel was with Kennedy — and Kennedy is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d41: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Anaconda Empress is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
