   "d41: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Callback is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d42: That night, they bring Kennedy home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [
   "d41: At the grave, Carmine, Yesenia, Ursula and 4 more speak for Madison — \"Kennedy trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
  ],
  "systemVoice": [
