   "d44: \"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Kennedy owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\"",
   "d44: \"Good question.\" \"I dreamed Kennedy was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\"",
   "d44: \"Good question.\" \"Kennedy is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\"",
   "d44: \"Nobody says Kennedy's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\"",
   "d48: \"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Since Kennedy died... I keep expecting to see Kennedy at the fire. Stupid.\"",
   "d48: \"The fire feels smaller without Kennedy. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
